# Before adding things like .DS_Store, ignores for your editors, etc, consider
# instead to use a global git ignore. This keeps the ignores here clean, and
# specific to this project - not your text editor, OS, or other tooling.
#
# Attempts to ignore files specific to your configuration will be rejected.

#
# Please justify all ignore entries with comments.

# Ignore cargo generated build artifacts from the template.
template/target/

# Ignore cargo generated build artifacts from the root workspace (foundation
# crates).
target/

# Local manifest of spawned projects (see config.template.json).
config.json

# The template ships a .claude/ directory that must be emitted into every
# spawned project, and the repo dogfoods the same gate through its own root
# .claude/.  /etc/gitignore (or a user-global ignore) excludes .claude/
# wholesale; re-include both copies so they track here.  Machine-local state
# stays ignored.
!template/.claude/
!.claude/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
